      "body": "It can take quite a few mouse-clicks for players to clear filters.\r\n\r\nWe _could_ add a `Clear filters` button. But,  a quicker way of implementing this would be to let the users cycle through `Hide filters` and `Show filters`.  We should intercept the `Hide filters` button, and insert code to clear any filters in place.\r\n\r\nSo. to clear all filters for a table, the player would click on `hide filters` then `show filters`, and any filters will have been cleared.",
